### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user1",
  "password": "password123",
  "email": "user1@example.com"
}

### Login with the registered user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user1",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Register an admin user (requires ADMIN role)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/admin/register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "username": "admin1",
  "password": "adminpass123",
  "email": "admin1@example.com",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### Access public endpoint (no authentication required)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/public

### Access protected endpoint (requires authentication)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/protected
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Access admin endpoint (requires ADMIN role)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}


